Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.20,Default,,0,0,,Your pattern should not need my server\Nto stay yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:11.30,Default,,0,0,,Stitch & Scale starts with a local project.\NNo account just to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:20.20,Default,,0,0,,But local is not magic. Clear your browser data,\Nand the notice says your local projects go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,,That is the trade: no forced upload,\Nand a responsibility to back up what you cannot afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,,I would rather show you the warning\Nthan hide behind a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,,Keep the work on your machine.\NThen help us test what comes next.
